>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1358797#post1358797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I really wish V5 fanboys wouldn't utterly misrepresent what people have said and just straight making shit up....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Right that's only for V5 haters to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-04T21:38:48-08:00","id":1358996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1358963#post1358963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Right that's only for V5 haters to do.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well, at least your not denying that thats what you did. As for labeling folks as haters....I think ' disappointed former fans' is probably a better description. And as I've just been made aware 'fanboys' can apparently have negative connotations so I myself should have said ' fans' instead. Apologies.<br /> <br /> Fine if you disagree with someones statement, but, please, at least attack the actual things written. I will commend you on not going straight to personal attacks like a certain very vocal V5 fan on FB and reddit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","user":"Damian May","date":". 01-05-2020, 12:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-05T04:24:35-08:00","id":1359042,"title":"","content":"But the idea of the masqeurade was always an attempt to not allow -AllOfHumanity- to war with vampires. There would always, always have been some leaks and humans in the know, but they've always, always been too disorganized usually too afraid to do anything about it.<br /> <br /> -All the world goverment agencies have secret compartments dedicated to ending vampires and they've all got in contact with eachother para-military religious/occult organizations with nothing in common getting together to fight vampires whilst not breaking the masquerade and not getting infiltrated and destroyed from within? That's contrived.<br /> <br /> V5 is so filled with absolute bullshit that I'm gonna assume W5, a game thats even more politically charged, is going to be filled with even more absolute bullshit.<br /> <br /> Edit: And werewolf has largely been about super-powered monsters fighting monsters in the spirit world. They've always been virtually immune to mortal authorities and have only had to worry about first teams and, rarely,skinners. Their biggest problem has always been infighting. The Very thing you criticise VTM for has been what werewolf was doing in spades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 01-05-2020, 07:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T01:32:59-08:00","id":1359222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1358996#post1358996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Well, at least your not denying that thats what you did. As for labeling folks as haters....I think ' disappointed former fans' is probably a better description. And as I've just been made aware 'fanboys' can apparently have negative connotations so I myself should have said ' fans' instead. Apologies.<br /> <br /> Fine if you disagree with someones statement, but, please, at least attack the actual things written. I will commend you on not going straight to personal attacks like a certain very vocal V5 fan on FB and reddit.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I am totally denying it. There isn't much to read from his words but taking the idea that A Second Inquisition is a joke when the FIRST is pretty much the primary cause of the Masquerade is pretty much the equivalent of saying &quot;Treating the Masquerade as a serious part of the setting&quot; rather than say focusing on anything else is a joke.<br /> <br /> But there are plenty of things I find dumb about v5. The Beckoning. The Sabbat just disappearing. The Camarilla thinking if they go luddite enough they can escape tech rather than trying to catch up? And some of the stuff seems like its getting rolled back(See London going from a completely kindred free city to a population of 100)<br /> <br /> But the idea that Humans finding out shit and it being bad for Kindred? That was already setup in v20. Read Hunters HUnted 2... it had Cartels driving Kindred out of cities... so... <br /> <br /> But yeah if you'd like to explain to me how i&quot;m supposed to read the SI is a joke that doesn't invalidate the whole premise of the Masquerade, please explain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T01:46:04-08:00","id":1359223,"title":"","content":"Or, better yet, go necro the VtM forum thread about that very subject since this is supposedly a thread about W5 and we're way off topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T01:47:55-08:00","id":1359225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1359222#post1359222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> I am totally denying it. There isn't much to read from his words but taking the idea that A Second Inquisition is a joke when the FIRST is pretty much the primary cause of the Masquerade is pretty much the equivalent of saying &quot;Treating the Masquerade as a serious part of the setting&quot; rather than say focusing on anything else is a joke.<br /> <br /> But there are plenty of things I find dumb about v5. The Beckoning. The Sabbat just disappearing. The Camarilla thinking if they go luddite enough they can escape tech rather than trying to catch up? And some of the stuff seems like its getting rolled back(See London going from a completely kindred free city to a population of 100)<br /> <br /> But the idea that Humans finding out shit and it being bad for Kindred? That was already setup in v20. Read Hunters HUnted 2... it had Cartels driving Kindred out of cities... so...<br /> <br /> But yeah if you'd like to explain to me how i&quot;m supposed to read the SI is a joke that doesn't invalidate the whole premise of the Masquerade, please explain.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> SI as an international off-the-books conglomerate comprised of dozen of different Alphabet agencies from around the globe in unison with a secret cabal of Church sorcerers and armed with military grade munitions that can obliterate multi-dimensional shielded and warded facilities and eradicate entire city populations of kindred and cover up all evidence perfectly? Yeah, they sound like someones bad home game Uber-GMPCs.<br /> <br /> Now that they're being wound back and downgraded successively in each release...perhaps not so much...but as presented in the Core, Anarchs and Cam? Definetely a laugh riot for myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T01:50:51-08:00","id":1359226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1359223#post1359223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or, better yet, go necro the VtM forum thread about that very subject since this is supposedly a thread about W5 and we're way off topic.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Apologies. Shutting down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-11T22:15:22-08:00","id":1360455,"title":"","content":"For a group of nerds who love role playing werewolves in an apocalyptic setting y\u2019all are real quick to write off a new game book set in said apocalyptic setting. <br /> <br /> Did any of you read the apocalypse book (I know most of you probably did it\u2019s a rhetorical)? Iirc it had 5 world ending scenarios. I look forward to a new book set in that timeline. If you don\u2019t like it then play in 20ths timeline which is years prior to the events of w5th. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m gonna keep my mind open and see what happens. Can\u2019t possibly be worse than changing ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T00:50:27-08:00","id":1360472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360455#post1360455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a group of nerds who love role playing werewolves in an apocalyptic setting y\u2019all are real quick to write off a new game book set in said apocalyptic setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pre-apocalypitic setting.<br /> <br /> And those us of with extreme lack of trust in the decisions made around the book have expressed pretty clear reasons behind it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I look forward to a new book set in that timeline. </div> </div> </div>Um, prepare for disappointment? The 5th books were stated to not be following the ToJ end game scenarios, but making up their own new timelines. V5 used elements from the Gehenna book, but didn't actually use any of the scenarios within.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you don\u2019t like it then play in 20ths timeline which is years prior to the events of w5th. </div> </div> </div>What about those of us that would like to see an updated WtA for 2020, but can't stand the direction V5 went? WtA is an old game. It needs a new edition that's more thorough in the updates than the collection of stuff that W20 is. &quot;Just go play W20&quot; is what we'll do, but that doesn't mean it actually is what we want.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can\u2019t possibly be worse than changing ways. </div> </div> </div>Oh yes it can.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T00:52:56-08:00","id":1360473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360455#post1360455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a group of nerds who love role playing werewolves in an apocalyptic setting y\u2019all are real quick to write off a new game book set in said apocalyptic setting.<br /> <br /> Did any of you read the apocalypse book (I know most of you probably did it\u2019s a rhetorical)? Iirc it had 5 world ending scenarios. I look forward to a new book set in that timeline. If you don\u2019t like it then play in 20ths timeline which is years prior to the events of w5th.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m gonna keep my mind open and see what happens. Can\u2019t possibly be worse than changing ways.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Apocalypse book is non-canon as of W5, just like V5 and BJD overwrote the VtM Gehenna scenarios.<br /> <br /> Considering W5 will need to go to the same folks who fugged Changing Ways for approval I hope they don't take that last sentence as a challenge. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T09:30:37-08:00","id":1360534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360473#post1360473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The Apocalypse book is non-canon as of W5, just like V5 and BJD overwrote the VtM Gehenna scenarios.<br /> <br /> Considering W5 will need to go to the same folks who fugged Changing Ways for approval I hope they don't take that last sentence as a challenge. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I was wondering wtf happened with changing ways because it\u2019s such a stark departure from the core lore. But we\u2019ll see. Like I said w5 can be good, we have no idea currently but I\u2019m curious to see what happens. Lotta fear mongering happening here.<br /> <br /> Edit: I mean the thread in general not necessarily your posts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T12:42:11-08:00","id":1360570,"title":"","content":"There's nothing quite as lazy as dismissing negativity as fear mongering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T13:16:10-08:00","id":1360578,"title":"","content":"Reread Changing Ways. Nothing about it is wrong or badly written. It had characters with morally abhorrent views. That's not a problem.<br /> depiction is not endorsement. It's wrong to blame the author for the something his character did.<br /> do you think George Lucas thinks the empire is cool? Do you blame him for the destruction of aldeeram?<br /> and about the writers of most batman movies? The villains in those movies did some pretty sick shit. Is it the writer's fault?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 01-12-2020, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T13:19:09-08:00","id":1360580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1359042#post1359042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But the idea of the masqeurade was always an attempt to not allow -AllOfHumanity- to war with vampires. There would always, always have been some leaks and humans in the know, but they've always, always been too disorganized usually too afraid to do anything about it.<br /> <br /> -All the world goverment agencies have secret compartments dedicated to ending vampires and they've all got in contact with eachother para-military religious/occult organizations with nothing in common getting together to fight vampires whilst not breaking the masquerade and not getting infiltrated and destroyed from within? That's contrived.<br /> <br /> V5 is so filled with absolute bullshit that I'm gonna assume W5, a game thats even more politically charged, is going to be filled with even more absolute bullshit.<br /> <br /> Edit: And werewolf has largely been about super-powered monsters fighting monsters in the spirit world. They've always been virtually immune to mortal authorities and have only had to worry about first teams and, rarely,skinners. Their biggest problem has always been infighting. The Very thing you criticise VTM for has been what werewolf was doing in spades.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have advice. Ignore v5. Pretend it doesn't exist. If you ever see anything v5 related. Turn the other way around. For your sake,do that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T15:37:43-08:00","id":1360600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360578#post1360578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reread Changing Ways. Nothing about it is wrong or badly written. It had characters with morally abhorrent views. That's not a problem.<br /> depiction is not endorsement. It's wrong to blame the author for the something his character did.<br /> do you think George Lucas thinks the empire is cool? Do you blame him for the destruction of aldeeram?<br /> and about the writers of most batman movies? The villains in those movies did some pretty sick shit. Is it the writer's fault?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dude, stop. We know for a fact that the book was altered and changed in many places by ' White Wolf' after it was submitted. These alterations stick out like dogs balls both in writing quality and alteration of established lore and canon.<br /> <br /> Please, just stop. It's embarrassing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T15:39:59-08:00","id":1360603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360580#post1360580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have advice. Ignore v5. Pretend it doesn't exist. If you ever see anything v5 related. Turn the other way around. For your sake,do that</div> </div> </div> </div>Nobody likes a Jnr Moderator wannabe, Ignore button is right there for your use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T15:58:55-08:00","id":1360604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360578#post1360578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reread Changing Ways. Nothing about it is wrong or badly written.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is plenty in there that's wrong for WtA, and other things that are badly written.<br /> <br /> Without even getting into some of the touchy stuff? The &quot;Chea&quot;t sidebar is wrong and badly written. It's wrong to advise STs to lie to their players, and it's bad writing to make it sound like you're making the game more fun by creating drama between the characters via misleading the players.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It had characters with morally abhorrent views. That's not a problem.<br /> depiction is not endorsement. It's wrong to blame the author for the something his character did. </div> </div> </div>Fuck, we're back to this shit?<br /> <br /> First off, a huge amount of W20 Changing Ways is written in the third person from the authors to the players/ST, because it's primarily a book about advice for playing the Garou more accurately. It is not a book where problems can simply be dismissed like this, because the book is explicitly <b>endorsing</b> specific game elements for various reasons.<br /> <br /> Second, the or statement undermines your position. The &quot;Werewolves and Gender,&quot; sidebar isn't necessarily wrong (the Garou being regressive shitheels isn't bad for the game, and trans Garou struggling with the fact that their bodies reject various attempts at transitioning), but it's poorly written. As has been noted countless times, it rejects something as basic as a common level 2 Rite that can make hormonal treatments work on Garou, and plays way too much into the idea that trans people need sexual reassignment to be happy. It also makes the Garou far too regressive along lines that don't make sense for the Garou to care about.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T16:27:09-08:00","id":1360606,"title":"","content":"Guess I got too pissed off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T17:12:05-08:00","id":1360609,"title":"","content":"I just want people to be less negative, is all. We need to remember there's real human beings making those games. And that belittling them and calling them horrible shit is wrong.<br /> Besides,w5 is not written yet. It doesnt make any sense to shit on a game if you dont knows anything about it.<br /> besides,if you have legitimate criticism. Its more likely it will be heard if you are polite about it. Again there's real human beings behind the game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 01-12-2020, 08:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T18:45:43-08:00","id":1360616,"title":"","content":"Have you considered that exaggerating what people are saying to ridiculous levels, and then being wildly negative even in response to the shit you're making up about would deserve as a response, is... the opposite of being less negative?<br /> <br /> People calling out WW and Paradox for the mistakes they've made handling the WoD property isn't belittling them. Yes they're real people behind the names of those corporate labels, but those real people are the ones that messed things up.<br /> <br /> You making up excuses to yell at people is belittling them.<br /> <br /> You've made it clear you don't really care about how polite criticism is, because there's plenty of it in this thread that you just don't want to acknowledge is legitimate. Just like you don't care about how negative things are, just policing who gets to be negative.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T18:56:39-08:00","id":1360617,"title":"","content":"Heavy,how can w5 criticism be legitimate. If w5 is not written yt?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T19:05:41-08:00","id":1360618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1353351-hunters-entertainment-with-paradox-to-create-werewolf-the-apocalypse-5th-edition?p=1360616#post1360616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you considered that exaggerating what people are saying to ridiculous levels, and then being wildly negative even in response to the shit you're making up about would deserve as a response, is... the opposite of being less negative?<br /> <br /> People calling out WW and Paradox for the mistakes they've made handling the WoD property isn't belittling them. Yes they're real people behind the names of those corporate labels, but those real people are the ones that messed things up.<br /> <br /> You making up excuses to yell at people is belittling them.<br /> <br /> You've made it clear you don't really care about how polite criticism is, because there's plenty of it in this thread that you just don't want to acknowledge is legitimate. Just like you don't care about how negative things are, just policing who gets to be negative.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've heard the white wolf personnel,called monsters,idiots,dumbasses. I've heard that they dont know what they doing. I've heard they having been called names again and again. Not an ounce of respect to them,they dont get respect as professionals,they dont even get respect as human beings.<br /> I've talked to them yknow? Sent them emails,pinged them on Facebook. They have been unfailingly kind to me. They have been kind to people who dehumanized them. Treated like dirt. Treated me like dirt. And for what? For making a new edition of a game?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 01-12-2020, 10:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T19:10:54-08:00","id":1360619,"title":"","content":"Also,I gotta say I'm disappointed with the admins not banning brothermouse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.t